        "instruction": "Remove the timing-mark and crankshaft-end access screws. Turn the crankshaft counterclockwise with a wrench until the rotor TDC mark aligns with the cover mark and both illustrated cam sprocket marks align with the head edge. Record the alignment. Do not force a binding engine.",
