        "instruction": "Remove the tensioner cap bolt, tensioner and gasket. Loosen all eight cam-cap bolts evenly in a crisscross pattern from outside inward. Lift the two caps while retaining both clips and dowels. Secure the timing chain with wire so it cannot fall, then remove the exhaust and intake cams. Keep caps matched to their original head and positions.",
