        "title": "Measure the cam lobes",
        "instruction": "Inspect each cam lobe for blue discoloration, pitting and scratches. Measure the illustrated lobe height with a micrometer: intake service limit 32.130 mm, exhaust 33.460 mm. Record each value; damaged or undersize cams require replacement.",
