        "instruction": "For an out-of-range journal clearance, measure the cam journal diameter against 21.959–21.972 mm. An out-of-range journal requires a new cam; if the journal is within range but clearance failed, replace the cylinder head and its cam caps as a matched set. Save the actual measurements and replacement decision. Remove the temporary cam installation and retain the components separately.",
