        "instruction": "Check chain links for damage or stiffness: a failed chain requires chain and camshaft replacement as a set. More than one-quarter tooth wear on the illustrated cam sprocket also requires that matched replacement. Inspect tensioner for cracking/damage; with light finger pressure on its rod, wind it fully clockwise using a thin screwdriver, release and verify smooth extension. Replace a failed tensioner assembly. Record decompressor cam smooth movement and projecting lever pin.",
