        "title": "Lift the cylinder",
        "instruction": "Remove the cylinder retaining bolt, lift the cylinder while supporting the piston and secured chain, and remove the base gasket and two dowels. Keep the case opening protected. Do not remove the exhaust-side chain-guide stopper plate in this bounded operation.",
