        "title": "Measure piston and actual fit",
        "instruction": "Measure piston diameter at the illustrated point 4.0 mm above the skirt bottom: 76.955–76.970 mm. Calculate actual fit as maximum measured bore C minus measured piston diameter; specified clearance 0.030–0.055 mm. Record both dimensions and the subtraction. An out-of-range piston diameter or clearance requires cylinder, piston and rings replaced as a set.",
