        "title": "Inspect piston pin and bore",
        "instruction": "Record pin discoloration or grooves; a damaged pin requires replacement and a lubrication-system investigation. Measure pin OD (minimum 15.971 mm) and piston pin bore ID (maximum16.043 mm); replace the failed pin or piston respectively. Record actual bore-minus-pin fit against 0.002–0.022 mm; an unresolved fit is not accepted for assembly.",
