        "instruction": "Read and record actual cylinder and piston grade marks. OEM matching is A to A/red (piston 66.352–66.355 mm), B to B/orange (66.356–66.359), C to C/green (66.360–66.363), D to D/purple (66.364–66.367). Cylinder grades are A 66.400–66.402, B 66.404–66.406, C 66.408–66.410, D 66.412–66.414 mm. A purchased cylinder cannot be ordered by grade: select the piston to its actual mark and verify clearance. Record accepted or replacement parts before assembly.",
