        "instruction": "Measure piston skirt diameter with a micrometer at the illustrated orientation, 17.5 mm from the skirt bottom. Standard diameter is 66.352–66.367 mm. Calculate actual maximum cylinder bore C minus measured piston diameter: specified clearance 0.045–0.050 mm. Record all three values. Replace out-of-specification parts following the OEM piston/ring-set and cylinder disposition; do not substitute nominal dimensions for a measurement.",
