        "title": "Check pin and small-end bearing",
        "instruction": "Check the pin for blue heat discoloration or grooves; replace it and investigate fuel/engine mixing oil if present. Record pin OD (minimum limit 17.975 mm), piston pin-bore ID (maximum limit 18.040 mm), and ID minus OD clearance (standard 0.004–0.020 mm; limit 0.065 mm). Follow OEM replacement of out-of-specification pin/piston, including the pair for excessive clearance. Replace a heat-discolored small-end bearing; record its condition and accepted replacement parts.",
