        "title": "Measure the cylinder",
        "instruction": "Inspect cylinder and piston walls for vertical scratches. Measure side-to-side and front-to-back at all three illustrated bore heights, recording D1–D6 and their maximum C. Standard bore is 77.000–77.010 mm; wear limit 77.060 mm. Scratches require cylinder replacement with piston/rings as a set. An out-of-spec bore requires cylinder reboring or replacement plus new piston/rings; machining is outside this inspection route.",
