        "title": "Right fork: set the locknut position and spring stack",
        "instruction": "Measure from the damper-assembly bottom to the locknut bottom exactly as shown; adjust the locknut until that distance is at least 16 mm. Install the upper spring seat with its larger-diameter end facing the spring, then the spring. Lower the damper assembly slowly into the inner tube until it contacts the bottom; do not drop it.",
