        "instruction": "Slide each leg back into its clamps. Temporarily secure it with the lower pinch bolts while leaving the upper pinch bolts loose. Tighten the damper assembly at the top to 30 N·m with the cap ring wrench. Set both supported fork legs to the standard5mm outer-tube projection shown before refitting the handlebar assembly.",
