        "title": "Restore the handlebar holders",
        "instruction": "After both damper caps are tightened and5mm fork projection is set, restore the four dampers and lower holders with the intact bar assembly. For this stock-position route, the longer distance from mounting-bolt center faces rearward as shown. Seat the original washers and tighten both lower-holder nuts to40 N·m. Keep the undisturbed upper clamps and bar alignment unchanged. Check full left/right steering for tank contact and cable/hose tension before proceeding.",
