        "id": "wheel-refit",
        "title": "Install the wheel and axle",
        "instruction": "Apply lithium-soap grease to the axle and wheel oil-seal lips. Put the side-specific collars back, lift the wheel into place with the disc correctly between the pads, and insert the axle. Thread the axle nut on by hand; leave its final tightening and the axle pinch bolts for the seating step.",
