        "instruction": "Engage the lower-bracket projection in the number plate, restore the clutch cable in its guide and fit the plate projection into the upper hole of its band. Tighten the number-plate bolt to7 N·m. Restore each recorded rebound and compression setting from gently seated full hard; confirm both legs match the intended setup.",
