        "instruction": "Check wheel rotation, smooth fork movement, hose clearance through steering travel and firm normal front-brake operation. Recheck your recorded hardware torques and matched projection. Save the oil quantities, measured gaps, replaced components, locking agent, torque records and final checks for both legs. Any binding, leak or soft brake remains a fault requiring correction before use.",
