        "title": "Assess the timing drive before selecting a crank",
        "instruction": "Remove the timing-chain guide stopper plate, exhaust-side guide and chain. Check for chain stiffness and guide wear or damage. A stiff chain requires replacement of the camshaft sprocket, chain and crankshaft sprocket as a set; a damaged crank sprocket requires a complete crankshaft replacement. Record the matched timing-drive decision now and coordinate the necessary cam/sprocket work with top-end closure. Replace a damaged or worn guide.",
