        "title": "Clean and inspect the retained cases",
        "instruction": "Remove the oil nozzle for cleaning and keep its direction indexed. Clean the cases with mild solvent and remove old gasket material without cutting the sealing faces. Inspect for cracks or damage; this route requires sound retained cases. Clear blocked oil passages with controlled compressed air, never spinning bearings with air. Remove solvent and loose debris and dry the cases before assembly.",
