        "instruction": "Support chassis, swingarm/rear wheel and shock independently so neither released joint carries spring or bike load. Remove the shock lower bolt and connecting-arm frame-side bolt as the exhaust prerequisites require. Preserve collars/seals and support the arm/shock without hanging from the remaining joints. Keep upper shock and other linkage pivots assembled.",
