        "title": "Disconnect starter, ground and plug interfaces",
        "instruction": "Disconnect coolant-temperature coupler and remove the head ground terminal bolt. Plug cap was released with the retained aircase group. At the starter lead pull back its rubber terminal cover and hold the motor-side nut with a spanner while undoing the lead nut. Release necessary lead clips and support harness clear. Leave motor and rigid motor covers installed; if terminal access is blocked, do not force it.",
