        "instruction": "Record the completed independent bench work, if any. Before refit confirm its timing, clearances, lubrication, free rotation and sealed cover/filter checks. This guide itself leaves engine internals intact. Keep the original swingarm and side stacks located on their temporary support and ready for the single pivot replacement.",
