        "id": "engine-engine-in",
        "title": "Place the engine back in the chassis",
        "instruction": "Bring supported engine in from the right, lower part first. Align mounts without trapping hoses or leads. Apply molybdenum-disulfide grease to the pivot shaft and insert from the right while withdrawing temporary support, preserving original swingarm side stacks. No lithium grease on pivot-nut threads is specified here.",
