        "instruction": "Record the exact repaired parts and completed engine-refit record. Accept cold clearances, timing, oil flow/levels, coolant fill, idle and controls before riding. The engine must now be fully cool. Any unresolved noise, leak or lubrication fault requires repair first. This companion does not itself perform engine removal/refit. Record verified exact oil-check-bolt fastening and seal closure before any engine start; unresolved closure prevents entry.",
