        "title": "Inspect the head and intake chain guide",
        "instruction": "Remove carbon with a rounded scraper, avoiding plug threads and sealing faces; remove deposits/rust from coolant passages. Inspect head damage/scratches and guide wear/damage; replace a damaged guide. Measure head warpage with straightedge and feeler gauge across the illustrated directions: limit 0.05 mm. This route retains a sound original head and excludes resurfacing or replacement of a damaged head.",
