        "instruction": "Cover the case opening before removing pin clips. Deburr the clip groove and pin bore area if needed; never hammer the pin. If it remains tight use the specified piston-pin puller. Remove pin and piston. Spread each ring only enough by hand to lift its opposite side over the crown, keeping top, second and oil rings identified.",
