        "id": "topend-bore",
        "title": "Measure the cylinder",
        "instruction": "Inspect cylinder and piston walls for vertical scratches. Measure side-to-side and front-to-back at the three illustrated heights, recording D1–D6; C is their maximum. Standard bore 97.000–97.010 mm, wear limit 97.060 mm. Scratched walls require cylinder replacement and piston/rings as a set. This route supports exact stock replacement, not rebore or replating.",
