        "instruction": "Measure piston diameter on the illustrated axis 9.0 mm above the skirt bottom: standard 96.955–96.970 mm. Calculate actual C minus piston diameter. The manual separately specifies 0.010–0.045 mm clearance and 0.15 mm limit. Preserve both stated ranges: individually acceptable diameters do not automatically establish an acceptable pair. Resolve a failing actual fit with the prescribed cylinder/piston/ring set replacement and remeasurement.",
