        "id": "topend-springs-lifters",
        "title": "Inspect springs and lifters",
        "instruction": "Measure spring free lengths: intake minimum 36.65 mm, exhaust minimum 35.55 mm. Replace failed springs with correct stock parts. Damaged or scratched lifters require lifters and cylinder head together; do not fit a fresh lifter into a failed head in this route.",
