        "instruction": "Place cams in the head, position Plastigauge on the illustrated journals, install dowels and matching caps, and tighten caps crisscross from inner to outer at 10 N·m. Do not turn the cams during measurement. Remove caps evenly and read the flattened strips. Required clearance is 0.028–0.062 mm. Clean off the Plastigauge before final assembly.",
