        "id": "topend-seats-reface",
        "title": "Have the seats refaced for the new guides",
        "instruction": "Have a qualified cylinder-head specialist reface every seat associated with a renewed guide before lapping. Record the actual completed service and resulting seat condition. Cutter selection, angles and material removal are not prescribed here; do not mark an arranged appointment as completed work.",
