        "instruction": "Clean stem ends; lubricate stems and all new stem seals with molybdenum disulfide oil. Fit each spring seat, new stem seal, accepted valve, spring and retainer. Original retained parts return to their original positions; renewed parts go to their recorded positions. Install springs with the larger pitch upward.",
