        "instruction": "With bike upright on level ground, warm for2–3minutes, stop and wait about1minute. Check that oil is above the window minimum mark. Remove the oil-check bolt: oil must not flow out; if it does, drain excess until the last drop stops. Add specified oil if at/below minimum. Restore the bolt and its seal using verified exact closure information and record actual fastening and leak-free closure; no nearby cover torque is a substitute. Both window and check-bolt criteria must pass.",
