        "id": "preflight",
        "title": "Perform the pre-ride inspection",
        "instruction": "Complete the pre-ride inspection: coolant/fuel/oil levels and no leaks; sequential shifts and smooth clutch; effective brakes; full throttle return and 3–6 mm free play; aligned lubricated chain; wheels/spokes/tires; smooth steering without play; smooth leak-free suspension; unrestricted cables and secure connectors. Cold tire pressure is 100 kPa (15 psi) front/rear. Correct failures before riding.",
