        "instruction": "Confirm the exact stock US 2023 YZ450F engine is cold, fully drained, removed and securely supported. Head, cylinder, piston and cams are already removed and separately indexed; the timing chain is retained. External clutch cable, coolant, exhaust and electrical connections are disconnected. This operation services crankcases, complete crankshaft assembly, gearbox and their required drives. It retains intact water-pump, pressure-relief and starter-motor internals. Resolve faults in those excluded systems before proceeding.",
