        "instruction": "Clean the lower intake joint, loosen its clamp and lift the intact throttle body clear. The grip-end cables were detached earlier; support the body and both identified cables separately outside the engine lifting path without tension. Keep body-end cable seats, sensors, adjustment screws and pulley intact; protect the engine intake and housing against dirt. The injector and sensor leads may remain connected while this group is supported next to the frame with slack; they must not carry its weight. Do not try to move it beyond their free reach.",
