        "instruction": "Bring the supported engine in from the right, lower part first, and align mounting points without trapping wires or hoses. Apply molybdenum-disulfide grease to the pivot and install from the right while withdrawing the temporary support shaft, keeping the original swingarm side stacks located. Apply lithium-soap grease to the pivot-nut threads and contact face.",
