        "instruction": "Install the new pipe-joint gaskets in their PDF198 positions. Refit the pipe-2 clamp, pipe 2 and bracket bolt. At each joint, engage the clamp projection in the pipe/silencer slot and keep the clamp off the raised projection illustrated in PDF204. Leave final bracket and clamp tightening until the silencer is seated.",
