        "title": "Seat the case and secure its mounts",
        "instruction": "Remove temporary inlet protection and seat the complete case fully on its original intake connection. Restore mounting collars, dampers and washers; tighten the three case bolts to 7 Nm and the air-filter-case joint clamp screw to 3 Nm. Restore the cylinder-head breather connection to the case if released and its original spring clamp. Check the lip is evenly seated, reconnect the intake-temperature coupler and restore its cover.",
