        "id": "engine-access-tank-install",
        "title": "Reconnect the fuel system",
        "instruction": "Refit the tank on its retained dampers/collars. Tighten its two front mounting bolts to 8 N·m and the tank retaining screw to 4 N·m. Remove the temporary joint covers, push the fuel hose fully onto the pipe until it clicks, and slide the connector cover back into its locked position. Keep the hose holder correctly oriented, with no kink or pinch. Reconnect the pump plug. Route both the fuel hose and fuel-pump lead through the guide on the cover as shown in PDF292.",
