        "id": "engine-access-body-install",
        "title": "Refit the panels and seat",
        "instruction": "Locate the radiator-guard projections in the shroud holes, then install the shrouds at 7 N·m. Refit the air-filter-case cover by engaging its projection and both ribs. Slide side-cover tabs into their slots; the right-cover rib sits under the rear-fender rib. Tighten ordinary left/right side-cover bolts to 7 N·m and the two seat bolts to 13 N·m. Refit the sub-seat with its tether untwisted, then press, rotate and secure its quick fastener. Restore the fuel-tank breather hose: protected end in the steering-shaft hole, other end on the fuel-cap projection, hose through the cover guide and seated in its groove as shown in PDF96.",
