        "instruction": "Remove carbon and inspect seats. Apply blue layout fluid to each valve face, press the valve through its guide against the seat, remove it and measure the contact band where blueing was displaced. Contact width limit is 1.5 mm for both intake and exhaust. Pitting/wear or failed original seat width requires head replacement under the inspection instructions and is outside this retained-head route.",
