        "instruction": "Use the specified 5.5 mm reamer after installation. Measure actual guide ID, new running-valve stem OD and clearance for every renewed position. Apply the same 5.500–5.512 mm ID, intake/exhaust minimum stem diameters 5.445/5.435 mm and clearance limits 0.080/0.100 mm. Confirm the running valves also pass the 0.020 mm runout check; remove all machining debris.",
