        "instruction": "Fit new drain gaskets: oil-tank bolt 10 N·m, crankcase bolt 20 N·m. Fill 0.96 L for this filter-removal service and apply lithium-soap-based grease to the new filler-cap O-ring before fitting the cap. Use Yamalube or an oil meeting API SG or higher and JASO MA; the listed SAE grades are 10W-40, 10W-50, 15W-40, 20W-40 or 20W-50. Do not add additives or use the source-prohibited CD-or-higher or ENERGY CONSERVING II oils. The settled window level is the final check. The 1.20 L disassembled capacity is not this service refill.",
