        "id": "access-engine-isolate",
        "title": "Isolate the battery",
        "instruction": "With the engine stopped, disconnect the negative battery lead first, then the positive lead. Insulate the loose terminals. Retain the battery and relay in place unless separate frame work requires removal; no starter action is allowed during the work.",
