        "id": "access-engine-cooling-prepare",
        "title": "Set up for a cold drain",
        "instruction": "Stand the cooled bike upright on a level surface. Place the collection container beneath the engine and position it close to the drain outlet, because flow can shoot sideways when the radiator cap is released.",
