        "id": "engine-electrical-right",
        "title": "Disconnect starter, ground and plug interfaces",
        "instruction": "Disconnect the coolant-temperature connector, pull the spark-plug cap clear without removing the plug, and remove the engine-ground terminal bolt. At the starter lead, hold the motor-side terminal nut with a spanner while undoing the lead nut. Release the lead clamps and support the harness away from the lift path.",
