        "title": "Disconnect the left engine harness interfaces",
        "instruction": "Release only the retaining clips/ties needed to free engine leads. Disconnect the stator, crankshaft-position and gear-position connectors; keep the gear-position switch bolted to the engine so its seal is not disturbed. Match connector identity to the diagrams, including the white 3-pin gear-position and gray 2-pin stator connectors. Label and protect both halves.",
