        "title": "Free the complete rear brake assembly",
        "instruction": "With the rear wheel removed, slide the complete caliper/bracket off its swingarm guide and release the hose retaining clamps. The pedal pivot/spring were already removed during engine access. Remove the two rear-master-cylinder mounting bolts and support master, hose, caliper and linked pedal together. Keep hose unions, reservoir, pads and pushrod pin attached; do not pump the pedal.",
