        "instruction": "Remove the two caliper mounting bolts and support the complete caliper so its weight cannot pull on the hose. Keep the hose union, bleed screw, pad pin and pads undisturbed. Release the brake-hose holder from the fork protector, preserving its orientation and paint-mark position.",
