        "instruction": "Battery leads are isolated. Release the battery band and lift out the battery. Unplug ECU, CCU and starter-relay harness couplers, releasing their covers first; retain the electronics in their original holders on the rear frame. Release the white/green-tape harness ties and clip so the main loom is free of the rear frame. Keep starter/positive leads on the relay and carry them with the rear frame; the starter lead is already free at the engine.",
