        "title": "Remove the rear-frame assembly",
        "instruction": "Support the rear frame with rear fender and electronics holders attached. Remove its four mounting bolts and lift the assembly clear, checking no wire, silencer or hose remains attached. Keep bolts mapped by position. The upper chain roller is separately bolted on this 2024 frame; remove that bolt and retain the complete roller/collar stack separately.",
