        "title": "Remove the remaining bolt-on frame parts",
        "instruction": "Remove each complete footrest bracket with its peg, spring and pin still assembled; retain the four bracket bolts by side. Remove the lower chain-tensioner bolt and intact roller/collar stack. Identify and retain any remaining clip-in harness holders and removable rubber mounting pieces in labeled positions. The steering races have been removed; bonded frame pads remain; this is not a paint-stripping or structural repair operation.",
