        "id": "pressure-test",
        "title": "Pressure-check the reinstalled cooling system",
        "instruction": "With coolant at the upper level, install the specified radiator tester/adapter and apply137.3 kPa; do not exceed that pressure. It must hold5–10 seconds. Check radiator joints and hoses for leaks or bulging, correct any fault, release pressure and cover the connection with a cloth before removing the tester. Secure the radiator cap. Do not perform this check on a hot pressurized system.",
