        "instruction": "Restore both shrouds with each radiator-guard projection engaged in its shroud hole; tighten shroud fasteners to 7 N·m. Refit the left side cover and its 7 N·m fasteners. Slide the right cover into its projection/slot engagement, keeping its rib below the rear-fender rib; fit its 7 N·m fasteners and shared seat fixing at 13 N·m as illustrated. Restore filter-cover projections/ribs and breather routing. Refit the seat with its bolts at 13 N·m and secure the sub-seat with untwisted tether. Confirm all connectors, wire clearance, fuel connections and oil closures before restart.",
