        "id": "commission-oil-flow",
        "title": "Check flow at idle",
        "instruction": "Start fully assembled engine at idle only and watch oil window for flow and decreasing level. Stop immediately if level does not decrease; diagnose lubrication before proceeding. Do not rev it to force a successful check.",
