        "id": "commission-final",
        "title": "Record actual maintenance completion",
        "instruction": "After the engine is fully cool, check coolant at the illustrated maximum and confirm no continuing loss. Open a radiator cap only cold, using a thick cloth and slow release to the detent; wait for hissing to stop before pressing/turning it off, and secure it after checking. Repeat the pre-operation checklist. Complete only with actual pressure-test, riding, oil/debris, generator, repaired-part fit, tank-cleaning, chassis and all-joint records accepted. Missing required work remains pending.",
