        "instruction": "Warm the oil to the specified normal 60°C (source says ten minutes; automatic idle stop may interrupt), stop, stand upright/level, run ten seconds, stop and wait a few minutes. Level must lie between lower window edge and maximum mark. Correct with specified oil, then warm several minutes, stop, settle and recheck. Record actual level/leaks; do not claim an unmeasured temperature was measured.",
