        "title": "Disconnect the tank",
        "instruction": "Unplug the fuel-pump connector. Put cloths below and around the fuel-hose joint for residual pressure. Remove the connector holder, slide the cover back, press its two release buttons and separate the joint by hand. Fit the supplied joint covers to both openings immediately.",
