        "id": "engine-access-case-release",
        "title": "Release the intact case",
        "instruction": "Disconnect the intake-air-temperature-sensor coupler by its connector latch. Loosen the air-filter-case joint clamp screw and remove the three case mounting bolts, retaining their collars, washers and dampers at the original locations. Keep the filter, temperature sensor and case assembly bracket attached to the case. Identify and release the cylinder-head breather connection to the air-filter case if it prevents free removal; retain its spring clamp and protect the opening.",
