        "instruction": "Lift the case clear of its seated intake connection without loading the remaining throttle body. Protect the exposed throttle-body inlet from dirt. Keep the case clean and inspect the joint and mounting supports for visible damage. Do not push the throttle valve, loosen sensor screws or move the cables.",
