        "instruction": "Open the sub-seat access and add clean recommended unleaded gasoline, minimum 91 (R+M)/2; E10 is permitted. Secure the fuel cap and sub-seat fastener with its tether untwisted. Check the pump connector and latched fuel hose/cover, and check for fuel leaks. Select neutral and work in a ventilated area before any starter operation.",
