        "title": "Verify oil flow immediately at idle",
        "instruction": "Start only after fuel, intake, cooling, electrical and mounting closure is complete. Keep the engine at idle; observe the oil-check window for oil flow and decreasing level. If the level does not decrease, stop the engine immediately and investigate the lubrication system instead of revving it.",
