        "title": "Warm for the operating checks",
        "instruction": "After initial idle oil-flow verification and with all fuel, cooling, intake and control closure complete, warm the engine for several minutes. Leave the radiator cap secured. Proceed to the following measured operating checks before stopping and cooling completely.",
