      "Unresolved actual piston/pin/ring fit or oil-rail assessment.",
      "Guide renewal without completed seat refacing or distinct new running valves.",
      "Unsupported pad chart selection or failed final cold clearance/timing.",
      "Foreign material, missing parts or abnormal resistance.",
      "Oil debris, flow failure, leaks or abnormal running",
      "Unresolved fit assessment or required inaccessible check",
