        "instruction": "Record clutch lever free play and the cable-end/adjuster positions. Release cable tension with the handlebar adjuster as necessary. Disconnect the engine-end cable nipple from the push lever and release the cable outer from its bracket as shown in the inset; keep the push lever, shaft and clutch cover installed. Retain the cable with its handlebar lever and support it clear of the engine lifting path. This bike has a cable clutch.",
