        "id": "topend-head-path",
        "title": "Choose retained valves or guide renewal",
        "instruction": "Continue into guide renewal only with a sound retained head, acceptable seats and lifters, appropriate replacement parts and arranged specialist seat refacing. A new running valve always requires a new guide; new valves used for lapping must be replaced by distinct new running valves. If all original valves/guides/seats passed and no lapping or machining is needed, choose the retained-valve branch instead.",
