        "instruction": "For a normally running engine, follow the oil-change warm-up then stop the engine; do not run a faulted engine solely to warm oil. Stand the bike upright, place drain containers and remove the filler cap and both oil drain bolts. Drain tank and crankcase. Leave the oil filter unchanged unless separately serviced. Install new drain-bolt gaskets: tank bolt 10 N·m, crankcase bolt 20 N·m. Mark the engine empty of oil.",
        "source_pdf_pages": [
          96,
          97
        ],
