        "instruction": "Confirm stator/sensor mounts and lead grommet remained intact. Fit two dowels and a new gasket, then cover and lead holder in recorded positions. Tighten eight bolts in stages crisscross to 10 N·m. Fit the oil-tank drain with a new gasket at 10 N·m and crankcase drain with a new gasket at 20 N·m if they were left out after draining.",
