        "instruction": "Clean carbon from grooves and rings before measuring. Top standard side clearance is 0.015–0.065 mm, limit 0.120 mm; second standard is 0.020–0.060 mm, limit 0.100 mm. An out-of-specification result requires piston and rings as a set.",
