        "title": "Accept the actual piston assembly",
        "instruction": "Record the exact stock parts retained or renewed. All required cylinder, piston, ring and pin checks must pass on the final chosen parts before assembly. Do not treat wear limits as an invented new-part target or infer correct fit from catalog sizes. Lubrication faults, unidentified parts and unresolved measured fit stop this route.",
