        "id": "head-in--prepare-bolts",
        "title": "Prepare the four main head bolts",
        "instruction": "Clean main-bolt threads/contact faces, both washer faces, head contact surfaces and crankcase threads. Apply molybdenum-disulfide grease to main-bolt threads/contact faces and both washer faces. Install main bolts/washers at positions1–4 in the installation diagram and seat lightly.",
