        "title": "Refit the assembly",
        "instruction": "Position and support the shock in its original orientation with the retained mount collars correctly seated. Install the upper bolt from the bike's right side. Raise the supported swingarm to align the lower mount, and install its bolt from the left side. Refit the corresponding mounting hardware without forcing misaligned parts.",
