        "instruction": "For the original pad number, convert only the last digit as Yamaha lists: 0/1/2 to 0, 4/5/6 to 5, and 8/9 to the next ten. For example, 148 becomes 150. Digits 3 and 7 are unspecified and stop selection. Use the intake chart on PDF94 or exhaust chart on PDF95: intersect the converted original pad column with the row containing the measured cold clearance. Record the selected number. A blank cell, unreadable number or reading outside/between listed intervals is unresolved; never extrapolate. The new pad must be the correct stock part with that chart number.",
