        "id": "remeasure",
        "title": "Measure all four clearances again",
        "instruction": "At the verified TDC position and with the engine still at room temperature, measure between each cam lobe and its lifter. Record all four results. Each intake must be 0.10–0.17 mm; each exhaust must be 0.15–0.22 mm. An unresolved boundary or out-of-range result is not a completed adjustment.",
