        "title": "Reseal the cylinder head",
        "instruction": "Remove tools and loose material from the work area. Refit the top timing-chain guide, a new cover gasket and a new spark-plug-hole gasket in their original positions. Apply ThreeBond No.1541C to the cover gasket as specified in the source diagram, seat the cover without trapping the seals, and tighten its three bolts evenly to 10 N·m.",
