        "instruction": "Use the removal-order diagram, which is different from the installation diagram. Loosen the twoM6x45 and fourM10x129 head bolts half a turn each per pass, positions1 through6, until all are loose. Then remove bolts/washers and lift the head without letting the chain fall.",
