        "instruction": "The retained-head path requires satisfactory head/valve inspection. If head repair, valve/guide replacement or cylinder/piston service is needed, complete and document that work before proceeding. OEM describes400–600-grit figure-eight resurfacing on a surface plate, rotating the head for even removal, but gives no maximum material-removal depth here; do not invent a skim allowance.",
