        "instruction": "Check piston and cylinder walls for vertical scratches; damaged walls require cylinder replacement with piston/rings as a set. Measure side-to-side and front-to-back at each of three illustrated heights. RecordD1–D6 and use their maximum as boreC. Standard97.000–97.010mm; wear limit97.060mm.",
