        "instruction": "Replace a blue-discolored or grooved pin and investigate lubrication. Measure pin outside diameter: minimum wear limit17.981mm. Measure piston pin-bore inside diameter: maximum limit18.045mm. Replace the defective pin or piston as specified.",
