        "instruction": "Record reuse or exact stock replacement decisions for every failed check. Where cylinder/piston/clearance is out of specification, follow OEM set-replacement requirements. Confirm the chosen actual piston/cylinder pair satisfies the required fit; do not accept it merely because both individual dimensions fall within their separate ranges. This guide excludes rebore/replate and aftermarket ring filing.",
