        "id": "cover-remove",
        "title": "Expose the valve train",
        "instruction": "Clean around the spark plug before removing its cap and plug. Disconnect the cylinder-head breather hose; remove the three cover bolts and lift off the cylinder-head cover. Keep the top chain guide and seals accounted for. Retain the top chain guide and do not remove any cam or tensioner hardware until the TDC and measurement steps are completed.",
