        "instruction": "Keep the engine at the confirmed TDC position. Remove the tensioner cap bolt and its gasket, then remove the mounting bolts and tensioner with its body and mounting-bolt gaskets. Preserve the sealing locations shown. Do not rotate the crankshaft with the tensioner removed.",
