        "instruction": "Loosen the cam-cap bolts evenly in a crisscross pattern from outside inward. Lift the caps and retain their dowels and exact original positions. Attach a clean wire to the chain to prevent it falling into the crankcase, then lift out the exhaust and intake cams. Leave the oil nozzle installed and retain crankshaft position.",
