        "instruction": "Place the cam in its matching head and position a Plastigauge strip on the journal as shown. Apply engine oil to cam-cap bolt threads/contact faces as specified for this joint; keep the Plastigauge measurement surfaces prepared according to its supplied instructions. Install dowels/caps, tightening inward-to-outward in a crisscross pattern to10Nm. Do not rotate the cam during the measurement. Remove caps and read strip width using the product scale; required clearance0.028–0.062mm.",
