        "instruction": "Check chain damage/stiffness and sprocket tooth wear against the drawing. More than one-quarter tooth wear requires camshaft and timing chain as a set; damaged/stiff chain requires the stated matching replacement set. Do not return a defective sprocket to service with only a new chain.",
